   "sourceHash": "7508ac7e493b716d617115828d966d142ea36051152239b1ea226c96f981c7e7",
   "text": "在日常生活中，我们需要应对和处理各种状况，无论是家庭、工作、人际关系还是其他责任。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bb565f05f0f492552daf",
   "sourceHash": "bb565f05f0f492552daf809c6348cfa0ded8d426114eaad89dcd053014115080",
   "text": "Ananda Lahari 瑜伽与阿育吠陀静修营 在日常生活中，我们需要应对和处理各种状况，无论是家庭、工作、人际关系还是其他责任。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_125561915b4284be1acb",
   "sourceHash": "125561915b4284be1acbeab2ea1507500420b69c0b35829a083be208de074f36",
   "text": "一位女士在椰子树环绕的花园池塘边，盘腿坐在石板上冥想",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0e490e0d654976696df3",
   "sourceHash": "0e490e0d654976696df35c1b2c4ca4bf860c140dc746f7060b5bf1158346312a",
   "text": "欢迎参加我们在喀拉拉邦帕拉卡德 Kairali 阿育吠陀疗愈村举办的瑜伽与阿育吠陀静修营。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_14d2bb162c4251bb6391",
   "sourceHash": "14d2bb162c4251bb63915943c5ad572c36563159a7e829dc101173999a792fde",
   "text": "Lakshya 瑜伽静修营欢迎参加我们在喀拉拉邦帕拉卡德 Kairali 阿育吠陀疗愈村举办的瑜伽与阿育吠陀静修营。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source concatenates title and sentence without a space; kept the concatenation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dedcd61dd063465092a9",
   "sourceHash": "dedcd61dd063465092a957e953d06562e6bde3addfe73798cf004a934ee2d646",
   "text": "盛在 Kairali 餐盘中的发芽绿豆沙拉，配胡萝卜、洋葱和柑橘片",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c28a4a00f2d87d7ef57a",
   "sourceHash": "c28a4a00f2d87d7ef57a803a39475d5db650f8561caec96d971c80698ebe498d",
   "text": "欢迎参加我们在喀拉拉邦帕拉卡德 Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村举办的主厨静修营。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_508a73068e89d502fd83",
   "sourceHash": "508a73068e89d502fd83ac30093fc8a9cf3841ab7a03961670cb7c135d7e6854",
   "text": "疗愈食谱：回归本源欢迎参加我们在喀拉拉邦帕拉卡德 Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村举办的主厨静修营。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source concatenates title and sentence without a space; kept the concatenation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dd6624c24977e0718dff",
   "sourceHash": "dd6624c24977e0718dffdafea307923deea350f4625090a8c54ef7a57ed35451",
   "text": "探索喀拉拉：“上帝自己的国度”的回水、山丘与文化",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_57eebef4ad0bf56e6483",
   "sourceHash": "57eebef4ad0bf56e6483d77fcf6f72d0628f7156e3a0fdbee4b4445c281b62d9",
   "text": "探索喀拉拉宁静的回水、多彩的文化、丰富的野生动物与精彩的探险活动。体验船屋、野生动物游览、节庆和如天堂般的自然美景。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7d5960664e12388f6768",
   "sourceHash": "7d5960664e12388f67681964ccc83f222fd5872c2abaa68bedec2e6ff72e2544",
   "text": "喀拉拉拥有壮丽的森林和波光粼粼的水景。这里值得体验的项目众多，其中包括带来宁静的船屋游览，以及穿行于广阔棕榈林荫下、令人心情振奋的车行之旅。喀拉拉的旅游业增速位居前列，这也不足为奇。这是一生难得的体验。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Pala trees' rendered as palm canopy (likely typo for palm); source claim 'fastest pace of tourist growth' softened slightly to 'among the fastest' — please confirm or keep literal."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_87269337734a69ed6b8b",
   "sourceHash": "87269337734a69ed6b8ba92d7704b79c5afe21de89a152018345590c7d8648ee",
   "text": "喀拉拉值得体验的活动：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_01de8bd13e449acd932b",
   "sourceHash": "01de8bd13e449acd932bd56b679beab3e2000848ce8b58e677f6edc77554149f",
   "text": "：参加野生动物自驾游，可以穿越喀拉拉葱郁的森林和野生动物保护区，收获一段难忘的经历。前往 Parambikulam、Wayanad 和 Periyar 等地，这里栖息着老虎、豹、大象及多种鸟类。在探险与自然的宁静之间，感受喀拉拉动植物迷人的美。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'journey' rendered as 经历 (experience) per banned-word rule."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ce57976a81ac656131c8",
   "sourceHash": "ce57976a81ac656131c86b48ac028c364c55f1f20311e982e644f5332cea6e20",
   "text": "：骑象游览能以独特的方式体验喀拉拉茂密的森林和风光。骑着雄伟的大象沿美丽的小径前行，您可以近距离亲近自然和野生动物。这一融合探险、文化与喀拉拉自然之美的精彩体验，在 Thekkady 和 Wayanad 广受欢迎。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
